り、ターン中行動できなくなってしまう\n\n・更に精神の侵食が進むと、味方側から敵側に位置(ポジション)を移動し\n戦闘中にも関わらず同族の♂と交尾を始めてしまう\n\n──という設定で\n\n①女戦士通常\n↓\n②女戦士ワーウルフ化【自慰】\n↓\n③敵の陣地中央にいるワーウルフ♂と交尾するワーウルフ化女戦士\n\n流れのイラスト』\n\nを、可能でしたらお願い致します！", "nc": 32, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/42", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 1415531, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d9ff6558/uploads/origins/c6c7d7ca-488b-41d1-8dad-321c96a5f192?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=489fa413bf3a4280ebe77c81cbf50a2a", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d9ff6558/uploads/origins/c6c7d7ca-488b-41d1-8dad-321c96a5f192?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=58d8f7c54aa92c0e83046f81430c7fe7", "src_set": ""}, "body": "hello i realy love your work, I'd like to request a 3 page tf into a food based \nAka a foodra\npage 1 kelly is enjoying the summer with ice cream in one hand, it started to have an effect on her and she starts becoming a icecream goodra a tail is growing out her and her belly is growing it's becoming a dark magenta her neck grows starts to grow a bit long as well\npage 2 her body is rapidly changing. The tail is getting thicker and her head is changing! her belly grew more and is starting to get filled with raspberry fizzy drink her hair becomes mint chocolate chip cream ice with raspberry juice her face is rapidy changing and her whole body just taste of ice cream The tail developed some icecream of its own and her boobs grew too big to a point where it's kinda leaking cream\npage 3 she became a fully big ice cream goodra mint chocolate chip she looks at all the sweet flavors and she enjoys what some more icecream\nkelly icecream foodra reffs https://imgur.com