genre": false}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/33", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 352722, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b3bae66b/uploads/origins/bdb9681a-78be-4347-89b2-4779f5e4d79b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb49d2cfcf410bdd495e718fca486955", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b3bae66b/uploads/origins/bdb9681a-78be-4347-89b2-4779f5e4d79b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=857428b06ee1267ea42ae7cf7c237057", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Nice to meet you.\nI saw your TF illustration of Mr. Sagara,\nI would like to make a request for a TF illustration of a girl who is my original character\nI would like to make a request for a TF illustration of a girl who is one of my own characters.\n\nI would like to request you to draw the girl in the URL, Yurisa Mehata, transforming into a Blutbad.\nI would like to ask for your help. I will leave the details of the composition to you.\n\nThe figure after the transformation\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/120335851\n(In the above material, the figure is completely naked,\n(Although she is completely naked in the above material, please describe her after the transformation with her pre-transformation clothes on.)\n\nThank you in advance for your consideration.\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/113636614", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/32", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 2906109, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e58aa6bf/uploads/origins/1680e8b1-f89f-435d-81eb-e6dfc9c8e2e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b870b9355721884f4995d91326badc4", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e58aa6bf/uploads/origins/1680e8b1-f89f-435d-81eb-e6dfc9c8e2e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=22efe4fed781a3e08275bbbe6bac52fd", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Dear Mr. I can't believe I'm here.\nIt is nice to meet you. My name is Kusawo Tsukasai.\nThank you for always posting your wonderful works. I love your style of carefully depicting scenes in which humans are transformed into non-humans.\nI would love to have you draw my original character as well, so I am going to take the plunge and send you a request.\n\nThe original character I would like to request this time is a priestess who turns into a wolf-beast. She is the main character in a transforming heroine story set in modern Japan, in which a petite and impotent human miko with a strong sense of justice is possessed by the spirit of a Japanese wolf, which transforms her into a powerful wolf-miko to exterminate evil spirits.\nWe would appreciate it if you could depict the miko during her transformation into a wolf-beastman for all ages.\n\nI will leave the situation and clothing to you, but I would be happy if you could depict her as being surprised and confused at the sudden start of her transformation!\n\nFor your reference, I have included my drawing of a miko in wolf-beast mode at the URL, but you are free to rearrange the character and clothing design as you wish.\nPlease feel free to arrange the design of the character and clothing as you wish!\n\nhttps://x.com/tsukamatsuri/status/1827363139979260299?s=46&t=61O2EAC-AaOW1HAdnj-xxA", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/31", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6443d023/uploads/origins/8826736b-0561-43c7-a17d-1cc8c59a9e6b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=58521dae60c4d3fa1cc9a4ae6adfd3b2", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 1670839, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 176, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/30", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0497ce55/uploads/origins/67dd2bcd-5d4d-42f4-b9f8-04031e025deb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4dc13e330e43fba4d23d891d497b8794", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 160, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/29", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 3181721, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/94b7ad6b/uploads/origins/b52d40fc-ccee-4d12-8554-7bf5b6b3f17f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4072bb386213965e92b1ca10a0db44aa", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/94b7ad6b/uploads/origins/b52d40fc-ccee-4d12-8554-7bf5b6b3f17f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=aff64aac60ee80212a1f1263602eb819", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたのTFアートがとても好きです！\nTSF+TFのシークエンスをお願いできますか? 私の氷竜のキャラクターの両性具有バージョンに変身する男性の人間（私）を見せたいのです！全裸になりたいのですが、よろしいでしょうか？(もしダメなら、服を破いて新しい性器を露出させるのを描いてもらっても構いません）。\n\n私の主な参考画像：https://www.furaffinity.net/view/54910741/ \n私のキャラクターの追加写真 https://www.furaffinity.net/view/55902493/ https://www.furaffinity.net/view/55492240/ \n人間の私はこんな感じです： https://imgur.com/a/t1OMZNi\n\n私は主に、胸が大きくなり、性器が変化することで感じる快感に焦点を当てたいと思っています。私が変身することで性的興奮が高まっていく様子を描いてください。コマ数はお任せします。\nひとつお願いがあります。https://skeb.jp/@doldolphin_r18/works/17 この漫画がとても好きです。できれば同じようなポーズで、最後の写真は6枚目のポーズ（膝立ちでカメラを振り返っているポーズ）でお願いします。\n\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1otVGMiAQjbykhBHovxYCZl7I3SBgSt_l?usp=sharing", "nc": 160, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/28", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e0c9df1c/uploads/origins/e8da5902-72a8-4692-abb6-d9fe39fc5b0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ef8fde4c7bc3de3cc0495ebd6b2953a6", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 1825060, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/27", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 2773706, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d0d2dfae/uploads/origins/865f5ab9-f095-4bb2-9249-e85e96ae8864?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=60aadd833c2955ac0ce636d5d498f7b4", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d0d2dfae/uploads/origins/865f5ab9-f095-4bb2-9249-e85e96ae8864?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f338d2d5b84c4a41a36bb77b61f87e28", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、ポケモン化シーケンスを依頼したいと思っています。 それは、ポケットモンスターサンの男性主人公であるヨウ♂が、ほぼ通常のアシレーネ♀に変身することになります。 乳首が見えない大きな胸。 3ページお願いします。 価格はご自身で調整してください。\n\nページ 1 には、ビーチの砂浜でアシレーヌ Z を見つけたヨウがあります。 そこから光が放出され、彼の中に流れ込みます。 彼は驚きのあまり仰向けに倒れてしまう。 ヨウの髪が青くなった。\n\nページ 2 には、ヨウが腕で身を支えています。彼の腕は足ひれです。 顔がアシレーヌに変わっていく。 髪が長いせいで帽子が落ちてしまう。 ヨウのシャツはサイズと胸が大きいために伸びます。 ヨウの足は尻尾と一体化し、ズボンと靴が引き裂かれます。\n\n3 ページ目では、彼女が自分の体を見ています。 彼女は全裸です。 彼女のすべての持ち物とアシレーヌZは砂の中に横たわっていた。 彼女は少し赤くなっています。\n\n３ページに背景を載せていただきたいと思います。 背景はシンプルなものでも構いません。 ポーズはすべてお任せします。 ありがとうございました。", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/26", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 2640703, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0a9956ee/uploads/origins/36c3dc65-4a3b-4f6f-bc30-3275bbf6dd01?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=17ed659e189593bd24af09cb5ae3926f", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0a9956ee/uploads/origins/36c3dc65-4a3b-4f6f-bc30-3275bbf6dd01?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b0a3f6a47e695c5bef8e16225919dc6f", "src_set": ""}, "body": "I want to request a TF sequence from a human male to my male owl sona. Could it be multiple stages?\n\nHuman reference is this twitter thread: (check the replies too) \nhttps://twitter.com/OlivineRiverAir/status/1656199256695271424\n\nOwl sona reference: \nhttps://twitter.com/OlivineRiverAir/status/1651331414208688128\n\nPart 1: He is confused as the changes start. He grows feathers, talons and his eyes begin to change colour.\n\nPart 2: A back view. His tail and wings begin to burst from his clothes. (I love how you do tail bursts)\n\nPart 3: The transformation hurts, but he is happy with the changes. He grows slightly taller as the horns emerge from his head and the rest of the transformation completes. \n\nThe TF can be SFW or NSFW (you can choose). If you do make it NSFW, can the penis transform to look like this? https://www.furaffinity.net/view/46922761/\n\nI know you usually draw female character TFs but I hope a 100% male TF is ok too. \n\nThank you so much!", "nc": 32, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/25", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bc547b3e/uploads/origins/97291b7a-4e69-42d8-a4ef-cf2cf56dad75?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a4f6c76bf66c355d77126ed1638b0b00", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 896460, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 32, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/24", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f167f9ee/uploads/origins/36ecfdcb-6d95-44fa-bf29-34df6509983f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=dec54e8fb39655dfa20db3e5bf935742", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 196610, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 50, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/23", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b6336511/uploads/origins/9c52fc16-6675-4f24-b49e-a731e87188bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81294933beb7e463bf251c3b378a151a", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b6336511/uploads/origins/9c52fc16-6675-4f24-b49e-a731e87188bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e4313a470f1dc0ea8fa9643d4e87bad5", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Is it possible to draw Li Dailin from Eternal Return Black Survival.\nFeel free to use either https://imgur.com/a/EzamONk or https://imgur.com/ECRobsS for the human form.\n\nI want to see her transform into a 化け狸 (bake-danuki). Since 化け狸 are famous for their testicles be sure to include large testicles, about the size of a baseball.", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/22", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e732726b/uploads/origins/32a984e6-28c6-498f-9e1b-ec761d4b0a6a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e3fe1f9be191c580b730e730afb014e8", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 176, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/21", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9e204a18/uploads/origins/64226632-8461-47d3-8376-666958b976f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7a0200255d76a35736d445448739de74", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 49, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/20", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 2598722, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/93b9719c/uploads/origins/16ad0679-1b8f-48d3-9241-3facb6b5da43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87678a2f99d3d13f4555021ab838b745", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/93b9719c/uploads/origins/16ad0679-1b8f-48d3-9241-3facb6b5da43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0663865e9836576a90d7058895f59bcf", "src_set": ""}, "body": "I like your illustrations on Pixiv and other sites very much and would like to make a request.\nCould you please produce a TF sequence from human female to Grant's zebra beasts in three stages?\n\nThe desired sequence is as follows.\nThe initial appearance of the female should be medium height and in underwear, with the details left to us.\nIn addition, we would appreciate it if you could consistently portray her in a bewildered manner.\n\n(1) A black-and-white striped pattern appears from her buttocks to her back as her tail pops out.\n\n(2) Hoofs appear on both arms, the neck and face extend and become covered with stripes, and at the same time, horse ears and mane are formed.\nThe hoof is not a fusion of fingers, but is formed by the abnormal development of the middle finger and the degeneration of the other fingers, according to the real horse skeleton.\n\n(3) The range of motion of the shoulders and hip joints will remain human, but the limbs will change to the shape of a horse, completing the transformation into a Grant's zebra animal.\nEspecially in stage (3), it would be greatly appreciated if you could make the pattern of the whole body as much like the real Grant's zebra as possible. (However, it would be better if the human hair remains)", "nc": 32, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/19", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 1415531, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b3a23130/uploads/origins/767e34c0-674c-4581-b483-b9ffcbcac817?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bc16f5311bf7c79f63b9cf7ef69bec0", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b3a23130/uploads/origins/767e34c0-674c-4581-b483-b9ffcbcac817?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c359c3ee0a686be8ded5d61816da3319", "src_set": ""}, "body": "hello i really like your art i'd like to commission you, i want my oc kelly to tf into a reshiram, I want it to be a 3 page tf please.\nall info will be below\n\npage 1 kelly on a cold night Stumbles upon the white stone puts it on her chest suddenly the stone is absorbed on her chest \n\npage 2 kelly realizes what just happened and starts to feel hot\nSomething is pushing on her pants and eventually a reshiram tail burst out\nShe then suddenly breathes fire and her head becomes a reshiram head \n\nPage 3 kelly grows in size and her neck grows\nHer body also grows into a reshiram body\nHer shoes are destroyed by her new reshiram talons \nLastly her arms become reshiram wings\nKelly who is now a reshiram looks shocked and confused\n\nkelly reffs https://imgur.com/a/BaPW8vc\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/BaPW8vc", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/18", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 654104, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0a736d36/uploads/origins/3dff6fbf-23b8-47e4-aae1-c820e6869845?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9725d662dca0b16e4e62be92ec97a17f", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0a736d36/uploads/origins/3dff6fbf-23b8-47e4-aae1-c820e6869845?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=009a97712655e2f2b0923c1c9affa9b0", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Draw whatever you want, no limits. It does not need to be of my character if you do not wish to draw her again.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/6N68BwA", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@doldolphin/works/17", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 338881, "client_id": 2199537, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cdaeb274/uploads/origins/bd8c17c3-95e5-47ea-b7a9-df92c524ca07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10e2efdfab887eb1c663dfd4bc719082", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cdaeb274/uploads/origins/bd8c17c3-95e5-47ea-b7a9-df92c524ca07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s